msgstr "<b>ສ້າງຜຽນວຽກ</b><br/><i>ເປີດແບບຟອມເພື່ອປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດຜຽນວຽກ.</i>"

#. module: planning_field_service
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:planning_field_service.planning_shift_ics_description_inherit
