#: model:mail.template,body_html:planning_field_service.mail_template_data_intervention_report
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"                Dear <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or 'Customer'\"/>,<br/"
"><br/>\n"
"                Please find attached the field service report for the recent "
"intervention. <br/><br/>\n"
"                If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact "
"us.<br/><br/>\n"
"                Best regards,<br/><br/>\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"                ຮຽນ <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or 'ລູກຄ້າ'\"/>,<br/>"
"<br/>\n"
"                ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງບົດລາຍງານການບໍລິການພາກສະໜາມສຳລັບການປະຕິບັດງານທີ່ຜ່ານມາທີ່ຄັດຕິດມາ"
"ນີ້. <br/><br/>\n"
"                ຖ້າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ສົງໄສໃດໆ, ກະລຸນາຢ່າລັງເລທີ່ຈະຕິດຕໍ່ຫາພວກເຮົາ.<br/><br/>\n"
"                ດ້ວຍຄວາມເຄົາລົບນັບຖື,<br/><br/>\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        "

